{
  "movie_id": 507000501,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 7.8,
      "end_time": 8.4,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 13.2,
      "end_time": 14.0,
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 14.4,
      "end_time": 15.2,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 16.6,
      "end_time": 18.2,
      "text": "Can’t sleep either, Eriko-chan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 19.5,
      "end_time": 20.2,
      "text": "Indeed..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 21.5,
      "end_time": 22.6,
      "text": "What a coincidence"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 24.6,
      "end_time": 28.2,
      "text": "...My Beloved is my destiny"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 29.0,
      "end_time": 31.2,
      "text": "He's my fated soulmate"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 32.1,
      "end_time": 34.6,
      "text": "Those fools who get in the way of my destiny with him..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 35.1,
      "end_time": 38.1,
      "text": "I always thought it was only natural to destroy them..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 40.5,
      "end_time": 44.5,
      "text": "My little brother's been changing, even without us noticing, Eriko-chan..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 45.0,
      "end_time": 47.1,
      "text": "He just keeps getting cooler, doesn’t he?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 47.5,
      "end_time": 48.1,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 48.3,
      "end_time": 52.6,
      "text": "The kind of little brother who makes all sorts of people happy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 53.5,
      "end_time": 56.2,
      "text": "And if he's getting happiness from them, too..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 58.5,
      "end_time": 62.2,
      "text": "...Then maybe they’re part of \"my Beloved's happiness\", too..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 62.4,
      "end_time": 64.0,
      "text": "Is that what you're trying to say?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 65.0,
      "end_time": 65.6,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 66.1,
      "end_time": 68.8,
      "text": "For the sake of achieving my little brother's true happiness"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 69.0,
      "end_time": 71.6,
      "text": "Of course you and I matter too, Eriko-chan, but..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 72.4,
      "end_time": 74.6,
      "text": "Don’t you think everyone else matters too?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 75.5,
      "end_time": 77.0,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 78.0,
      "end_time": 80.0,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 82.2,
      "end_time": 85.3,
      "text": "I thought I was the only one who could bring him happiness..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 85.5,
      "end_time": 87.6,
      "text": "...but I guess I was wrong."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 88.2,
      "end_time": 90.5,
      "text": "It seems the truth is more complicated than that"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 91.5,
      "end_time": 92.2,
      "text": "However..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 92.6,
      "end_time": 95.6,
      "text": "Now we know what to do"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 96.2,
      "end_time": 97.2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 99.5,
      "end_time": 101.1,
      "text": "You're right"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 106.4,
      "end_time": 108.2,
      "text": "Shizuru-san, I..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 108.4,
      "end_time": 111.6,
      "text": "I'd like to give my Beloved his best summer memories as a present"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 113.0,
      "end_time": 114.2,
      "text": "Me too"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 114.4,
      "end_time": 117.8,
      "text": "A summer vacation that he will never forget"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 118.0,
      "end_time": 119.0,
      "text": "I want to produce it for him"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 120.6,
      "end_time": 122.0,
      "text": "It seems the two of us get along quite well"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 122.2,
      "end_time": 123.6,
      "text": "Hehe, you're right"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 125.2,
      "end_time": 126.0,
      "text": "All right!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 126.4,
      "end_time": 127.6,
      "text": "Let's do this, Eriko-chan!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 128.5,
      "end_time": 131.1,
      "text": "Yes, let’s do our best, Shizuru-san"
    }
  ],
